  "details": "With the introduction of the new nameplate design, usability as seen a significant decrease.\n\nAction icons are missing, such as the muted icon, while others are poor contrast, such as the age verified icon.\n\nThese icons shouldn't be placed on the banner.\n\nThe banner has also seen poor cropping with name length and in insistency across the whole UI.\n\nThere's also lots of discussion online about the new nameplates. Revert the nameplates to their old totally functional and serviceable design.",
